{"943370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bravery and Greed", "steam_appid": 943370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2207410], "detailed_description": "<h1>God of the Hunt update out now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/14631e293b5fd551e285aeaee0d9cf45.poster.avif?t=1780479530\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/14631e293b5fd551e285aeaee0d9cf45.webm?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/14631e293b5fd551e285aeaee0d9cf45.mp4?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on a fearsome new boss? The God of the Hunt Update is now LIVE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new boss! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Class changes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug fixes &amp; improvements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and more! Are you brave enough to face the challenge?</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/3ddd886a07ad716e97c4422125282943.avif?t=1780479530\" width=680 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether you're playing as the mighty Amazon, the valiant Warrior, agile Rogue or spell-weaving Wizard, each class possesses a breadth of fantastic and powerful combo move sets. Parry, dodge, juggle, zone and unleash destructive special moves to take the upper hand against ever mightier foes, bosses and even your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/2e1ba6c35d96f93b5c05f3083572e901.poster.avif?t=1780479530\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/2e1ba6c35d96f93b5c05f3083572e901.webm?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/2e1ba6c35d96f93b5c05f3083572e901.mp4?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/9c16009f5b72c5be928a61bf8bca1226.avif?t=1780479530\" width=680 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of thrilling environments in Adventure Mode as you tackle biomes and bosses in your search for runes to the Sky Fortress. Team up with friends and battle against wave after wave of enemies in the challenge Survival Mode or settle the grudge with arena-based team and solo PvP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/6df76a73c510c9a7e58a35335a948cc6.poster.avif?t=1780479530\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/6df76a73c510c9a7e58a35335a948cc6.webm?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/6df76a73c510c9a7e58a35335a948cc6.mp4?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/56734f945a74023758420ea2599e3ae8.avif?t=1780479530\" width=680 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with class choice, you will have to make on-the-fly decisions that alter your character skillset. Skill trees focusing on the aspects of Chaos, Order, Darkness and Life will grant you skill augmentations and special abilities, whilst a myriad of equipment drops ensure that every run feels unique with plenty of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/91e9e7bea70f130443fa6fecf93267e3.poster.avif?t=1780479530\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/91e9e7bea70f130443fa6fecf93267e3.webm?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/91e9e7bea70f130443fa6fecf93267e3.mp4?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/8524a0ba9c22c53e9ebc7251a2db5c0f.avif?t=1780479530\" width=680 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Bravery and Greed, you can permanently unlock awesome content and game-altering augmentations by levelling up with gold. Greedily grab coins and plunder chests, steal pockets of gold when reviving allies, or be the first to run and grab loot after an epic encounter, get rich or die trying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/dc1df70f2c73b6e8c44e23623f2bda9b.poster.avif?t=1780479530\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/dc1df70f2c73b6e8c44e23623f2bda9b.webm?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/dc1df70f2c73b6e8c44e23623f2bda9b.mp4?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/3ddd886a07ad716e97c4422125282943.avif?t=1780479530\" width=680 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether you're playing as the mighty Amazon, the valiant Warrior, agile Rogue or spell-weaving Wizard, each class possesses a breadth of fantastic and powerful combo move sets. Parry, dodge, juggle, zone and unleash destructive special moves to take the upper hand against ever mightier foes, bosses and even your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/2e1ba6c35d96f93b5c05f3083572e901.poster.avif?t=1780479530\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/2e1ba6c35d96f93b5c05f3083572e901.webm?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/2e1ba6c35d96f93b5c05f3083572e901.mp4?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/9c16009f5b72c5be928a61bf8bca1226.avif?t=1780479530\" width=680 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of thrilling environments in Adventure Mode as you tackle biomes and bosses in your search for runes to the Sky Fortress. Team up with friends and battle against wave after wave of enemies in the challenge Survival Mode or settle the grudge with arena-based team and solo PvP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/6df76a73c510c9a7e58a35335a948cc6.poster.avif?t=1780479530\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/6df76a73c510c9a7e58a35335a948cc6.webm?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/6df76a73c510c9a7e58a35335a948cc6.mp4?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/56734f945a74023758420ea2599e3ae8.avif?t=1780479530\" width=680 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with class choice, you will have to make on-the-fly decisions that alter your character skillset. Skill trees focusing on the aspects of Chaos, Order, Darkness and Life will grant you skill augmentations and special abilities, whilst a myriad of equipment drops ensure that every run feels unique with plenty of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/91e9e7bea70f130443fa6fecf93267e3.poster.avif?t=1780479530\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/91e9e7bea70f130443fa6fecf93267e3.webm?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/91e9e7bea70f130443fa6fecf93267e3.mp4?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/8524a0ba9c22c53e9ebc7251a2db5c0f.avif?t=1780479530\" width=680 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Bravery and Greed, you can permanently unlock awesome content and game-altering augmentations by levelling up with gold. Greedily grab coins and plunder chests, steal pockets of gold when reviving allies, or be the first to run and grab loot after an epic encounter, get rich or die trying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/dc1df70f2c73b6e8c44e23623f2bda9b.poster.avif?t=1780479530\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/dc1df70f2c73b6e8c44e23623f2bda9b.webm?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/extras/dc1df70f2c73b6e8c44e23623f2bda9b.mp4?t=1780479530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Bravery and Greed is a beat 'em up, roguelite, dungeon brawler for up to four players. Choose from four classic fantasy classes, engage in a deep robust combat system, and play a variety of co-operative and competitive game modes with friends via local, online or both. Get rich, or die trying!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "reviews": "“great soundtrack and beautiful pixel graphics”<br>9/10 – GameGrin<br><br>“cruel and harsh, but oh so rewarding”<br>8/10 – Movies Games and Tech<br><br>“If you need a game that’s fun, has fast, enjoyable combat, good variety, and replayability, then look no further than Bravery and Greed”<br>8/10 – NoobFeed<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/header.jpg?t=1780479530", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780479530", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/943370/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780479530", "website": "https://braveryandgreed.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-650 or AMD Phenom II X4 965<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 8800 GT, 512 MB or AMD Radeon HD 6570, 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 550 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Low 720p @ 30 FPS. 4 players gameplay.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br>